y the 2 people who gunned the rancher down, preformed a slaughter. Yet, no one in government has stepped up to shine any light on justice in any way whatsoever with this rancher&amp;#39;s death.  People better wake up because government employees do not serve the taxpayers whatsoever. And in fact, they have no intentions of doing so. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3941295591941954849/comments/default/8799689067664260624'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3941295591941954849/comments/default/8799689067664260624'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/07/we-have-duty-to-submit-they-have-no.html?showComment=1469114195989#c8799689067664260624' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/07/we-have-duty-to-submit-they-have-no.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3941295591941954849' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3941295591941954849' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-676186773"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 21, 2016 at 9:16 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5502502353058355468</id><published>2016-07-20T15:46:00.889-06:00</published><updated>2016-07-20T15:46:00.889-06:00</updated><title type='text'>ANONYMOUS #666 ~&#xa;Gee, you really bruised my feelin...</title><content type='html'>ANONYMOUS #666 ~&lt;br /&gt;Gee, you really bruised my feelings. I hope I&amp;#39;m not psychologically scarred for life due to your vicious but intellectual and warranted attack.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;